# kasukabe-world.service EnvironmentFile.
# Copy to world.env (untracked, contains no secrets today but keep the
# pattern) and fill in. world/app.py is still a /health-only scaffold as
# of this writing (its own module docstring says so) - it has no
# config.py / env-var surface of its own yet. The one var below is read
# by supabase/config.py, which world/'s eventual SupabaseClient use will
# pick up automatically once world/ starts constructing one (world is the
# single writer for agents, transactions, businesses, organizations,
# petitions, cases, buildings, skills, tools_registry, relationships,
# world_snapshots - app/CONVENTIONS.md).

# Shared SQLite trace DB (DESIGN.md section 9's SQLite-replaces-Supabase
# decision, 2026-07-30). Same path broker.env's KASUKABE_SQLITE_PATH
# points at and litestream.yml (owned by the trace-store track) will
# replicate to S3 - all three MUST agree on this exact path.
KASUKABE_SQLITE_PATH=/opt/kasukabe/data/kasukabe.db
